  "description": "A vulnerability was detected in grimmory-tools grimmory up to 3.3.3/3.4.1. Affected by this vulnerability is the function streamFileToResponse of the file backend/src/main/java/org/booklore/controller/KoboController.java of the component Download Endpoint. Performing a manipulation of the argument bookId results in authorization bypass. The attack may be initiated remotely. The exploit is now public and may be used. Issue #2431 is closed as completed, but its only comment states that the issue \u201chas already been reported elsewhere.\u201d No fixing commit or pull request is identified there.",
